@startuml
title Cycle 5 - Machine d'etats applicative KodaMate

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #246B80
  BackgroundColor #F7FCFF
}

[*] --> Launching

Launching : page de chargement
Launching --> LoggedOut : session absente\nou invalide
Launching --> OfflineRecovery : session presente\nmais backend injoignable
Launching --> RobotSetup : session valide\nrobot non configure
Launching --> MainShell : session valide\nrobot configure

OfflineRecovery : session effacee\nmessage de reconnexion
OfflineRecovery --> LoggedOut

LoggedOut : LoginPage
LoggedOut --> ServerTesting : TestServerCommand
ServerTesting --> LoggedOut : OK ou erreur affichee
LoggedOut --> Authenticated : login OK
LoggedOut --> LoggedOut : login KO

Authenticated --> RobotSetup : km_robot_configured=false
Authenticated --> MainShell : km_robot_configured=true

RobotSetup : saisir settings robot
RobotSetup --> MainShell : PUT /settings OK
RobotSetup --> RobotSetup : validation ou erreur

MainShell : Home, Chat,\nHistory, Settings
MainShell --> MainShell : refresh, chat,\npower, history
MainShell --> SettingsEditing : onglet Settings
SettingsEditing --> MainShell : sauvegarde ou retour
MainShell --> WifiModal : choisir SSID
WifiModal --> MainShell : SSID sauve localement
MainShell --> LoggedOut : LogoutCommand\nsession.Clear()

@enduml
